Delegate big independent work (scouting, sourced research, investigations, multi-file edits, reviews); handle small tasks directly. Put one investigation with ordered steps in one delegate; parallelize independent units{{ if ge .DelegationAllowance 2 }}; use one coordinator for coupled reports{{ end }}.

